  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "とくべつな　スティックで　リズムを\nきざむと　くさばなを　げんきにする\nパワーが　おんぱになって　ひろがる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "특별한 스틱으로 리듬을 타면\n화초를 생생하게 만드는 힘이\n음파가 되어 퍼진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當牠用特別的木棒敲奏時，\n能夠給予花草活力的力量\n就會變成音波擴散開來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le rythme qu’il crée en tapant avec son bâton\ntrès spécial génère des ondes sonores\nqui ont le pouvoir de vivifier les plantes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Rhythmus, den es mit seinem besonderen\nSchlägel erzeugt, verbreitet Schallwellen, die\nPflanzen neue Vitalität verleihen können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al marcar el ritmo con su baqueta especial,\nproduce unas ondas sonoras capaces de devolver\nla vitalidad a la flora.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Segnando il ritmo con la sua bacchetta speciale\ndiffonde onde sonore che hanno il potere\ndi rinvigorire fiori e piante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it uses its special stick to strike up a beat,\nthe sound waves produced carry revitalizing\nenergy to the plants and flowers in the area.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "特別な　スティックで　リズムを\n刻むと　草花を　元気にする\nパワーが　音波になって　広がる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "当它用特别的木棒敲奏时，\n能够给予花草活力的力量\n就会变成音波扩散开来。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al marcar el ritmo con su baqueta especial,\nproduce unas ondas sonoras capaces de devolver\nla vitalidad a la flora.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "スティックの　れんだで　こうげき。\nすごい　スピードで　たたくうちに\nどんどん　テンションが　あがるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "스틱으로 연타하여 공격한다.\n굉장한 속도로 치다 보면\n점점 텐션이 올라간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用木棒連續擊打來攻擊。\n在以飛快的速度擊打的同時，\n情緒也會變得越來越高漲。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il attaque en frappant frénétiquement avec\nson bâton. Son enthousiasme grandit à mesure\nque le rythme s’accélère.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es greift an, indem es wiederholt seinen Schlägel\nschwingt. Diese rasanten Trommelbewegungen\nbringen es immer mehr in Fahrt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca golpeando sin cesar con su baqueta, con\nun entusiasmo que crece a medida que acelera\nel ritmo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attacca percuotendo il nemico con la sua\nbacchetta, con un entusiasmo che cresce\nall’aumentare del ritmo sfrenato con cui colpisce.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It attacks with rapid beats of its stick.\nAs it strikes with amazing speed, it gets\nmore and more pumped.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "スティックの　連打で　攻撃。\nすごい　スピードで　叩くうちに\nどんどん　テンションが　上がるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用木棒连续击打来攻击。\n在以飞快的速度击打的同时，\n情绪也会变得越来越高涨。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca golpeando sin cesar con su baqueta, con\nun entusiasmo que crece a medida que acelera\nel ritmo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "もっている　スティックは　サルノリのたいないからの　エネルギーを　あびてかたさと　しなやかさが　ましている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "지니고 있는 스틱은 흥나숭의 체내에서 나오는 에너지를 받아 더 단단해지고 탄력이 생긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手中的木棒因為沐浴著來自敲音猴體內的能量，於是變得更加堅硬且柔韌。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le bâton de Ouistempo est devenu plus solide et plus souple après avoir absorbé l’énergie qui émane de son corps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Schlägel, den es bei sich trägt, nimmt Energie aus Chimpeps Körper auf und wird dadurch robuster und biegsamer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La baqueta que posee Grookey se vuelve más flexible y resistente cuando absorbe la energía que emana de su cuerpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La bacchetta che ha con sé assorbe energia dall’interno del suo corpo, diventando al contempo più resistente e flessibile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The stick Grookey holds has grown harder and more flexible after soaking in the energy that emanates from inside Grookey’s body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "持っている　スティックは　サルノリの体内からの　エネルギーを　浴びて堅さと　しなやかさが　増している。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
